# Cloudflare Pages redirects for Zhihua Moulds
# Note: Cloudflare Pages natively 308-redirects /foo.html → /foo (clean URLs).
# Now that canonical/sitemap/internal-links point to clean URLs, that 308 is normal
# canonical resolution, not an "error" from Google's perspective.
#
# IMPORTANT: Cloudflare Pages _redirects has a static-rule limit (~100 rules).
# We only keep high-value PAGE-level redirects here. Deleted/renamed PRODUCT IMAGE
# files are NOT redirected (190+ image rules would exceed the limit and silently
# disable every rule after the cap). Old image URLs have no inbound/sitemap links;
# Google re-crawls the new image URLs from the rebuilt pages + sitemap, so image 404s
# do not affect page indexing.

